 text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-all\",\"children\":\"$$150K\"}]]}],\"$L31\"]}],\"$L32\"]}]]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/paycheck-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-emerald-500 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 hover:shadow-emerald-500/30 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-5 w-5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"line\",\"7eqyqh\",{\"x1\":\"12\",\"x2\":\"12\",\"y1\":\"2\",\"y2\":\"22\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1b0p4s\",{\"d\":\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\"Try Our Paycheck Calculator\"]}]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0kxe9smv8dkyp.js\",\"async\":true}]\n14:[\"$\",\"$L33\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$34\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@35\"}]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"This one's personal. A few years back, one of those 'free' tax prep sites got caught selling user income data to data brokers. Like, your actual salary. So yeah — all the math runs right in your browser. Your numbers never touch our servers. We couldn't see them even if we wanted to. No accounts, no cookies on calculations, no way to tie results back to you.\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Built for Real People\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Built for Real People\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"We're not just building for accountants. We're building for the teacher in Chicago who just got a job offer in Houston and wants to know if the $10K raise actually means more take-home. Or the freelancer in Brooklyn drowning in quarterly estimates. Or honestly, anyone who's looked at their pay stub and thought 'wait, that much?' Yeah — these tools are for you.\"}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"4.4% flat tax\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"Washington\",{\"href\":\"/washington-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-muted/20 p-3 hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Washington\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"0% state income tax\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"Pennsylvania\",{\"href\":\"/pennsylvania-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-muted/20 p-3 hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Pennsylvania\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"3.07% flat tax\"}]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"Ohio\",{\"href\":\"/ohio-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-muted/20 p-3 hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Ohio\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"0%–3.5% progressive\"}]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"$L15\",\"New Jersey\",{\"href\":\"/new-jersey-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-muted/20 p-3 hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"New Jersey\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"1.4%–10.75% progressive\"}]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"We now cover all 50 states with dedicated income tax calculators — from zero-income-tax states (TX, FL, WA, NV, WY, AK, SD, NH, TN) to the highest-tax states in the country (CA, NY), with flat-tax states (IL, CO, IN, PA) and progressive states across the country. Plus, our \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/sales-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline\",\"children\":\"Sales Tax Calculator\"}],\" covers all 50 states with combined state + local rates.\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Beyond state calculators, we also built tools for\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/mortgage-calculator\",\"className\":\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline\",\"children\":\"mortgage amortization\"}],\" \",\"(with an extra payments feature that shows exactly how much interest you can save),\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/401k-retirement-calculator\",\"className\":\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline\",\"children\":\"401(k) retirement projections\"}],\",\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/capital-gains-calculator\",\"className\":\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline\",\"children\":\"capital gains tax estimation\"}],\",\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/self-employment-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline\",\"children\":\"self-employment tax calculations\"}],\", and a\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/relocation-calculator\",\"className\":\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline\",\"children\":\"relocation calculator\"}],\" \",\"that answers the question: “How much would I need to earn in State B to match my take-home pay in State A?”\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg bg-muted/20 p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\",\"children\":\"Professional Review\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Every calculation methodology gets reviewed by tax professionals before it goes live. They check that our bracket logic, deduction rules, and FICA calculations follow current tax law. And when we find an error — it happens, we're human — we fix it and document what changed. No quiet corrections.\"}]]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-4 mt-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-amber-200/90 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-amber-300\",\"children\":\"One more thing:\"}],\"TheTaxCalc gives you estimates, not tax advice. Our tools don't replace a CPA who knows your specific situation inside and out. Use us to plan and estimate — then talk to a professional when it's time to actually file.\"]}]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z\"}]}],\"LinkedIn Profile\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"div\",\"david-chen\",{\"id\":\"david-chen\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-david-chen.webp\",\"alt\":\"David Chen, EA — Tax Research Director & IRS Practice Lead\",\"width\":56,\"height\":56,\"className\":\"h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-emerald-500/30 mb-4\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"David Chen\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"EA\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3\",\"children\":[\"Tax Research Director & IRS Practice Lead\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":\"David Chen is an IRS Enrolled Agent (EA) with 15+ years of experience representing taxpayers before the IRS in audits, collections, and appeals. He specializes in self-employment tax, quarterly estimated payments, independent contractor classification, and IRS dispute resolution. David is a member of the National Association of Enrolled Agents (NAEA) and the California Society of Enrolled Agents. He holds a Master of Taxation (MTax) from San Jose State University and has completed advanced coursework in IRS Circular 230 ethics. David regularly contributes to tax policy analysis and has been quoted in publications including Tax Notes and the Wall Street Journal tax section.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"Self-Employment Tax\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Self-Employment Tax\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"Estimated Tax Payments\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Estimated Tax Payments\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"IRS Representation\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"IRS Representation\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"Tax Audits\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Tax Audits\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/davidchenea/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z\"}]}],\"LinkedIn Profile\"]}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"div\",\"sarah-johnson\",{\"id\":\"sarah-johnson\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-sarah-johnson.webp\",\"alt\":\"Sarah Johnson, CFP® — Financial Planning Specialist & Retirement Tax Strategist\",\"width\":56,\"height\":56,\"className\":\"h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-emerald-500/30 mb-4\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Sarah Johnson\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"CFP®\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3\",\"children\":[\"Financial Planning Specialist & Retirement Tax Strategist\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":\"Sarah Johnson is a CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER™ (CFP®) professional with over 10 years of experience helping individuals optimize their retirement savings, investment tax strategies, and long-term wealth building. She specializes in 401(k) optimization, Roth conversion strategies, capital gains harvesting, and required minimum distribution (RMD) planning. Sarah is a member of the Financial Planning Association (FPA) and holds the Chartered Retirement Planning Counselor (CRPC®) designation. She earned her BS in Finance from Indiana University and completed the CFP® certification program at Northwestern University. Sarah has presented at the FPA Annual Conference and contributes regularly to retirement planning publications.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"Retirement Planning\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Retirement Planning\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"401(k) Optimization\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"401(k) Optimization\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"Capital Gains Tax\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Capital Gains Tax\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"Investment Tax Strategy\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-muted/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Investment Tax Strategy\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sarahjohnsoncfp/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z\"}]}],\"LinkedIn Profile\"]}]]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"All tax data and calculation methodologies on TheTaxCalc are reviewed by our expert team and verified against official IRS publications and state revenue department sources.\"}]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1akyts\",{\"d\":\"M12 7v14\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ruj8y\",{\"d\":\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Primary Source Verification\"}]]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"We cite official sources for every tax figure: IRS Publication 15-T for federal withholding, IRS Rev. Proc. 2025-25 for 2026 inflation adjustments, state revenue department publications for state-specific rules, and the Social Security Administration for the annual wage base. Outdated or broken links are reviewed quarterly.\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-zap h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1xq2db\",{\"d\":\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Annual Update Cycle\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Tax brackets, standard deductions, FICA rates, and state tax rules are updated annually as soon as the IRS and state revenue departments publish new figures — usually in October–December for the upcoming tax year. Each page displays a “Last reviewed” date so you know exactly when the content was last verified. Mid-year legislative changes (like the 2025 overtime tax exemption) are published within 30 days of IRS guidance.\"}]]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Corrections Policy\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"If we make a mistake, we fix it — fast and visibly. Reported errors in calculation logic are investigated within 48 hours. Confirmed errors are corrected, the page is republished with an updated review date, and a note explaining the change is added to our methodology page. We do not silently edit content after publication without disclosure.\"}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-shield h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"oel41y\",{\"d\":\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Conflict of Interest Policy\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"TheTaxCalc does not accept paid placements, sponsored calculator recommendations, or affiliate commissions from tax-preparation software companies. Our recommendations are based solely on what we believe serves the user. We display ads (Google AdSense) clearly labeled as advertising, separate from editorial content.\"}]]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-3 w-3\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"dzmm74\",{\"d\":\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" CPA-Reviewed\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-3 w-3\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"dzmm74\",{\"d\":\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" E-E-A-T Compliant\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-3 w-3\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"dzmm74\",{\"d\":\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" IRS Source-Verified\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-3 w-3\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"dzmm74\",{\"d\":\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" Updated for Tax Year 2026\"]}]]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"qrunsl\",{\"d\":\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Nope. When you type your salary into one of our calculators, that number stays in your browser. It never gets sent to our servers. We don't have accounts, we don't use tracking cookies on calculations, and we couldn't tie your data to you even if we wanted to — because we never see it.\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Do you cover all 50 states?\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"qrunsl\",{\"d\":\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes. We cover all 50 states with dedicated income tax calculators — from zero-income-tax states (TX, FL, WA, NV, WY, AK, SD, NH, TN) to the highest-tax states (CA, NY), plus flat-tax states (IL, CO, IN, PA, MI, MA) and progressive states across the country. Each state has its own calculator with dedicated brackets, exemptions, property tax data, and retirement considerations. We also cover all 50 states for sales tax calculations.\"}]]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"When do you update tax brackets?\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"qrunsl\",{\"d\":\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"As soon as the IRS and state revenue departments publish new figures — usually late Q4 or early Q1. We don't wait for tax season to start. If the IRS releases updated brackets in November, our calculators reflect them in November. Our 2026 data is current as of January 2026.\"}]]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"details\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Can I use this to file my taxes?\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"qrunsl\",{\"d\":\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Please don't. Our calculators are for estimation and planning — figuring out if that job offer in Florida really means more take-home pay, or how much you'd save with extra mortgage payments. When it's time to actually file, use real tax preparation software or work with a CPA who knows your situation. We're a starting point, not a substitute.\"}]]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"href\":\"/salary\",\"className\":\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"}],\"All Salary Levels\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"h